  "description": "Beautifully maintained and perfectly positioned, this charming villa is nestled within a quiet, well-kept Over 55's complex and ideally located at the end for added privacy.<br/><br/>Offered furnished (including washing machine), the home is designed for comfortable, low-maintenance living.<br/><br/>The property features a spacious kitchen and bathroom, providing both functionality and comfort. Enjoy year-round climate control with split system air conditioning in both the master bedroom and lounge, complemented by ceiling fans in the dining area and both bedrooms.<br/><br/>Both bedrooms feature built-in robes, while the master also benefits from a security roller shutter for added peace of mind.<br/><br/>The home includes a single lock-up garage and a lovely, easy-care courtyard-perfect for relaxing and enjoying the surroundings.<br/><br/>Conveniently located directly across from Warwick Grove Shopping Centre, with public transport and parks just moments away.<br/><br/>Please note: This property is strictly for residents aged 55 and over.",
